<title>HONG KONG: Dransfield forms marketing joint venture.</title>
<headline>Dransfield forms marketing joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer products distributor and manufacturer Dransfield Holdings Ltd said on Sunday it formed a joint venture to market and distribute United States products in China and branded Chinese products in the U.S.</p>
<p>The joint venture was formed with international business development company Global Access Corp, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
